45
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Method 2. Use a professional scanner.

46
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Use a professional scanner, such as WeZoo, Revolbet, etc.

47
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:26,000
With professional pattern processing software,

48
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:32,000
